SUMMARY:[Stanford BeWell / Stanford Healthy Living] Intro to Nature Journa
 ling
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260828T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260828T170000
DTSTAMP:20260825T135102Z
UID:stanford_campus-localist-52901302543123-52901302545174@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Nature journaling is a peaceful activity to help you unwind\, 
 slow down\, and find wonder and joy in the little things. It is also a med
 itative activity that emphasizes the process over the product. It is about
  noticing and recording what piques our curiosity using words\, pictures\,
  and numbers.\n\nJoin us for a hands-on workshop on Stanford campus that w
 ill help you hone your close observation skills\, practice being curious o
 n purpose\, and deepen your relationship with nature through nature journa
 li\n\nAges: All ages\nSource: https://healthyliving.stanford.edu/classes/r
 egister/class_detail.php?t=1cce34dfd3cbss383d348a508b1be48cc821&ci=1252756
