UID:stanford_campus-law-10003231-1790703000-1790710200@law.stanford.edu-20
 26-09-29T17:30:00-07:00@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Join the Stanford Law Alumni Association and Cooley LLP for a 
 discussion on the Supreme Court featuring faculty from Stanford Law’s Su
 preme Court Litigation Clinic and prominent Supreme Court advocates—Pame
 la Karlan\, Jeffrey Fisher\, and Brian Fletcher. The discussion will be mo
 derated by Elizabeth Prelogar\, partner at Cooley and former Solicitor Gen
 eral of the United States. \nThe panel will examine the Court’s most con
 sequential decisions from its recently concluded term before turning to ca
 ses\n\nAges: All ages\nSource: https://law.stanford.edu/event/the-supreme-
 court-the-last-term-the-next-term-and-the-future-of-the-court/\nLast synce
 d: 2026-08-25 06:51 PDT
LOCATION:Cooley LLP – Palo Alto\, 3175 Hanover Street\, Palo Alto\, CA\,
  94304-1130\, United States
URL:https://law.stanford.edu/event/the-supreme-court-the-last-term-the-nex
 t-term-and-the-future-of-the-court/
END:VEVENT
